{
  "id": 8833359675591,
  "title": "Nature Tree of Life Quilt Set with Blooming Tree and Bedroom And Exposed Roots",
  "handle": "nature-tree-of-life-quilt-set-with-blooming-tree-and-bedroom-and-exposed-roots-d5450715a6-d5450715a6",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the symbolic beauty and serene energy of nature with the Custom Tree of Life Quilt Set by Jeminise. Perfect for nature lovers, this beautiful bedding set brings warmth, comfort, and a touch of farmhouse charm to any bedroom decor. Designed for year-round versatility, it provides lightweight warmth in the summer and cozy, breathable comfort during the colder winter months.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your bedding with options to tailor the background, framing colors, and text squares to feature your own sayings, pets, or loved ones' names.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High-Quality Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% soft polyester with a high-quality silk floss filling, ensuring a breathable, durable, and long-lasting comfortable feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Highly functional design that works beautifully as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, backyard picnic mat, or camping companion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from a range of sizes to suit your space, including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Pillowcases:</strong> Complete your custom bedding set by selecting your desired quantity of matching pillowcases (available in 2-pack or 4-pack options).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Low-maintenance fabric that is machine washable, quick-drying, and designed to resist pilling, fading, and wrinkling over time.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Yggdrasil, Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Farmhouse</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Nature, Flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcases (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
